sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Monitor
    participant S as Service
    participant P as Pager
    M->>S: Register probe
    loop every minute
        M->>S: Ping
        alt is up
            S-->>M: Pong
        else no answer
            M->>P: Raise incident
        end
    end
    opt after hours
        P->>M: Escalate
    end
